  "summary": "Hey there! I'm Ondia Brown, a passionate software engineer with a knack for turning ideas into reality through code. Graduating from a private high school in 2019, I chose a unique path, bypassing traditional college education to dive headfirst into the world of coding. Through a year-long extensive program, I honed my skills and landed an internship at JPMorgan Chase, where I've been fortunate to continue my journey for over three years now.\n\nMy time at JPMorgan Chase has been nothing short of exhilarating, collaborating with talented teams to develop innovative solutions that drive impact and efficiency. Beyond the code, I'm deeply passionate about continuous learning and personal growth. Whether it's staying updated on the latest technologies or embracing new methodologies.\n\nI'm always eager to expand my horizons and push the boundaries of what's possible.\n\nLet's connect and explore how we can collaborate to create something extraordinary.",
